cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PortXR in research or write about it, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PortXR: play flat PC games in VR (Unity, Unreal Engine and Godot)"
abstract: "Free, open-source tool that adds VR to flat PC games made with Unity, Unreal Engine and Godot: 6DOF stereo rendering through OpenXR, motion controllers as gamepad or keyboard and mouse, head or hand aim, the game's UI on a panel, and a big-screen mode for every other game."
authors:
  - alias: EncidXVII
version: 0.7.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/EncidXVII/PortXR"
url: "https://everyvr.net/portxr"
keywords:
  - virtual reality
  - VR mod
  - flat to VR
  - OpenXR
  - Unity
  - Unreal Engine
  - Godot
  - BepInEx
  - VR injector
